["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">易</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>容易；简单；交换；贸易；占卜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エキ・イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やさ.しい・やす.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">易しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やさしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">容易；简单；平易</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貿易</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうえき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（对外）贸易；国际贸易；进出口贸易</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">容易</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">容易；简单；轻易</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">速</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>快速；迅速；加速；提早</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はや.い・はや-・はや.める・すみ.やか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">速い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はやい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">快；迅速；敏捷；高速；早；尽早；比平时更早；过早；为时尚早；容易；简单；快捷；一…就…；刚…就…；瞬间…</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">急速</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうそく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迅速；快速</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高速</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうそく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高速；快速；急速；高速公路；快速路；高速干道</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">存</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>存在；认为；保存；觉察；询问</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\