" lang=\"ja\">はへん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">碎片；破片；碎屑；残片</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">除</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>除去；排除；取消；废除；除法（数学运算）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョ・ジ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">のぞ.く・-よ.け</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">掃除</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">清扫；打扫；擦拭；刷洗</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">除く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">除去；消除；去掉；清除；排除；除外；略去；剔除；除掉；消灭；诛杀</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">削除</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さくじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">删除；消除；擦除；划去</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">完</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>完成；结束；完美</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完成</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；完善；成就</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完全</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完美；完全；完整</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完了</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；结束；完成时；完成式</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">降</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>下降；降落；降下；投降；降伏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ゴ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.りる・お.ろす・ふ.る・ふ.り・くだ.る・くだ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">降る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（雨、雪、灰等）降落；下落；（霜）降；（霜）结；（阳光、月光）照射；倾泻；（幸运、不幸等）降临；来临；到来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">降りる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おりる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">下降；下来；降下；下车；下船；下马；离开；下台；退职；放弃；退出；认输；获得；颁发；给予；形成；凝结（霜、露、雾等）；排出；排泄（蛔虫等寄生虫）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">降り出す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふりだす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">开始下雨；开始下雪</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">責</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>责任；职责；责备；谴责</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">せ.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">責任</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せきにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">职责；责任（含对下属的监督责任）；责任；义务</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">責める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谴责；指责；批评；非难；控告；督促；催促；纠缠；折磨；拷问；迫害；调教；驯服（马匹）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">責務</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せきむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">职责；义务</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">捕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>捕捉；捕获；抓住；逮住；囚禁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.らえる・と.らわれる・と.る・とら.える・とら.われる・つか.まえる・つか.まる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">捕まえる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つかまえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">捉住；逮捕；抓获；扣押；抓住；握住；紧握；截住；拦住；挽留；阻止；扣留；朝向；对着；冲着</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">逮捕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいほ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">逮捕；拘捕；捕获</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">捕まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つかまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">被抓住；被逮捕；抓住；握住；找到；得到；被拘留；被扣留</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">危</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>危险；恐惧；不安</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あぶ.ない・あや.うい・あや.ぶむ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">危ない</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あぶない</span><span class=\"k-wz\">危险的；有风险的；危急的；险峻的；不稳妥的；处于危险中；危在旦夕；情况严重的；岌岌可危的；不确定的；不可靠的；无把握的；不稳定的；靠不住的；千钧一发的；侥幸的；勉强的；可疑的；不正当的；不正经的；小心！当心！注意！危险！</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">危険</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">危险；危难；危害；风险；危险</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">危うい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あやうい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">危险的；处于危险中；面临迫在眉睫的危险；危殆的（局势）；岌岌可危的（状态、平衡等）；悬而未决的；受到威胁的；不稳定的；不可靠的；令人担忧的；令人忧虑的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">苦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>痛苦；苦难；苦恼；苦涩；苦味</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くる.しい・-ぐる.しい・くる.しむ・くる.しめる・にが.い・にが.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">苦的；苦味的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦痛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">痛苦；苦楚；折磨；痛楚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦労</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くろう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳苦；辛苦；困难；辛劳；忧虑；担心；焦虑；挂虑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">迎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>迎接；欢迎；会见</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むか.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">迎える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むかえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迎接；接待；欢迎；问候；致敬；召唤；邀请；传唤；接纳；接受（如加入某团体或家庭）；娶（如娶妻）；到达（某一时间、人生某一阶段等）；进入（新阶段、新时代等）；迎来（如死亡）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">歓迎</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんげい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">欢迎；热烈招待</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">迎え</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むかえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迎接；问候；欢迎；前去迎接来访者的人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">園</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>庭园；公园；农场；牧场</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">その</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">公園</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうえん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公园；公共园林</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">動物園</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どうぶつえん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">动物园；动物园林</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">園芸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんげい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">园艺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">具</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>工具；器具；具备；材料；套（量词）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">グ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そな.える・つぶさ.に</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">具合</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐあい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">状况；状态；健康；健康状况；方式；方法；样子；情况；运气；际遇；面子；体面；得体；礼仪</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">道具</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どうぐ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工具；器具；用具；装置；设备；手段；家具</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">家具</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かぐ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">家具</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">辞</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>辞职；推辞；词语；措辞</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">や.める・いな.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辞書</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じしょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">字典；词典；辞典；辞职信；辞呈</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辞典</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">字典；辞书；词典</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辞める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">辞职；退休；辞去；离职</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">馬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>马</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バ・メ・マ・ボ・モ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うま・ま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">馬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">马；赛马；龙马；骑士牌</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">馬鹿</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">白痴；傻瓜；愚人；愚蠢的；傻的；呆板的；荒唐的；可笑的；微不足道的；琐碎的；令人失望的；失灵的；故障的；感觉迟钝的；极其；异常；非常；狂热爱好者；迷；痴迷于某事的人；中国蛤蜊（学名 Mactra chinensis）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">競馬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赛马；赛马运动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">愛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>爱；喜爱；疼爱；珍爱；爱慕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">アイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いと.しい・かな.しい・め.でる・お.しむ・まな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">爱；喜爱；关怀；（佛教）爱欲；贪爱；执著；（基督教）圣爱；神爱；阿加佩；爱尔兰</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愛情</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あいじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">爱情；爱；感情</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愛する</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あいする</span><span class=\"k-wz\">爱；热爱；喜爱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">富</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>富裕；丰富；使富裕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ・フウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.む・とみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">豊富</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">丰富；充裕；富有；充分</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">富</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">财富；财富；资产；资源；彩票</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">富む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">富有；充满；充足；丰富；富裕；富有</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">彼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>他；那；那个</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かれ・かの・か.の</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">彼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かれ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">他；男友；男朋友</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">彼女</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かのじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">她；女朋友；女友</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">彼ら</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かれら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">他们；她们；它们</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">未</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>尚未；仍然；地支第八位</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ミ・ビ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いま.だ・ま.だ・ひつじ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">未来</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（遥远的）未来；来世；彼岸；将来时态</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">未満</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みまん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">少于；不足；低于</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">未</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひつじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">羊（十二生肖第八位）；公羊；山羊；未时（午后两点左右；下午1-3点；下午2-4点）；西南偏南；未方；农历六月</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">舞</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>舞蹈；飞舞；盘旋；旋转</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ブ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.う・-ま.う・まい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お見舞い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おみまい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">探病；慰问；问候；慰问信；慰问函；祝愿康复的信；慰问品；击中；命中；打击</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">舞台</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">舞台；戏台；舞台演出；舞台表演；话剧；戏剧；故事背景；场景；活动领域；舞台；场所；竞技场；世界</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">見舞い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みまい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">探望；慰问；问候；慰问信；问候信；慰问礼物</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">亡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>死亡；灭亡；去世；已故；消亡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ・モウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">な.い・な.き-・ほろ.びる・ほろ.ぶ・ほろ.ぼす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">亡くなる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なくなる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">死亡；去世；逝世</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">死亡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">死亡；死；死亡率</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">亡くす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なくす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（因死亡）失去；丧失（妻子、孩子等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">冷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>冷；凉；冷却；使凉；变凉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つめ.たい・ひ.える・ひ.や・ひ.ややか・ひ.やす・ひ.やかす・さ.める・さ.ます</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷たい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つめたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷的；冰冷的；冻的；冷淡的；冷漠的；无情的；漠不关心的；不友善的；疏远的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷蔵庫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぞうこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷藏柜；冰箱；冷柜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷房</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">空调；制冷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">適</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>适合；偶尔；罕见；合格；有能力</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かな.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">適当</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てきとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">恰当；妥当；适宜；合适；得体；敷衍；不认真；马虎；懒散；草率；含糊其辞；不可靠；不负责任；仓促</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">快適</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいてき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">舒适；愉快；宜人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">適切</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てきせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">恰当；适当；得体；恰切</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">婦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>妻子；妇女；新娘</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よめ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">看護婦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんごふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">护士；女护士</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">主婦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">家庭主妇；主妇；家庭妇女</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫婦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふうふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">夫妇；夫妻；婚配的夫妇</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>靠近；聚集；顺路停留；寄送；收集</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.る・-よ.り・よ.せる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寄る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接近；靠近；走近；聚集；集合；汇聚；顺路拜访；顺道造访；中途停留；变老；（数字等）增加；起皱；产生皱纹；靠着；倚靠；斜靠；抱住对手腰带推动（相扑技法）；商定价格；成交；受（某人）左右；屈从；顺从</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寄付</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">捐献；捐赠；贡献</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">年寄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">としより</span><span class=\"k-wz\">老年人；老人；老年公民；相扑协会理事；退役高级力士教练；德川幕府元老；资深政治家；德川幕府重要地方官员</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">込</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>拥挤；混合；包含；装入；集中</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">-こ.む・こ.む・こ.み・-こ.み・こ.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">込む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拥挤；密集；堵塞；复杂；繁复；进入；进去；放入；完全变成；彻底成为；彻底地做；充分地做；保持；维持（沉默、坐姿等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">人込み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひとごみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">人群；熙攘的人群</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し込む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしこむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">申请；提出申请；求婚；提出调停；提出和平提议；挑战；提出异议；请求面谈；认购；预订</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">顔</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>脸；表情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かお</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">笑顔</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えがお</span><span class=\"k-wz\">笑脸；微笑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">顔付き</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かおつき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">面容；面貌；神情；表情</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">類</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>种类；类别；同类；类似</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ルイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たぐ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">種類</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">种类；品种；类型；类别；种（用于计数种类、物种等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">書類</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">文件；文书；证件</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">人類</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じんるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">人类；人类社会</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">余</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>剩余；过多；其他；自己；余数</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あま.る・あま.り・あま.す・あんま.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余分</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よぶん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">多余；过剩；剩余</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余裕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">盈余；余地；余量；空间；富余；灵活；范围；从容；镇定；沉着；泰然自若；自满</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">余る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">剩余；剩下；过剩；过多</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">王</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>王；统治；大人物</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ・-ノウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">国王；统治者；君主；帝王；大王；巨头；大亨；高手；冠军；（将棋）王将（上手一方所用的王）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王様</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうさま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">王；国王</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王子</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">王子；熊野附属神社</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">返</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>归还；返回；回答；报答；消退</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かえ.す・-かえ.す・かえ.る・-かえ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">返す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かえす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">归还；返还；放回；翻转；倒转；颠覆；偿还；报复；回报；回应；顶嘴；回答；反驳；反向做……（如反驳；反扔）；再做；反复做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">返事</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へんじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">回复；答复；回答</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">繰り返す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くりかえす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">重复；再做一遍</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">妻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>妻子；配偶</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妻子；配菜（尤指刺身的装饰菜）；装饰菜；陪衬；附带事物；附带的话；插话</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫妻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">夫妻；夫妇；已婚夫妇</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">背</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>身高；背部；违背；背叛；背后</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">せ・せい・そむ.く・そむ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">背</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">背部；后背；反面；背面；椅子靠背；书脊；身高；身材；山脊；山梁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">背広</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せびろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">商务套装；西装</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">背中</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せなか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">背；背部</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">熱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>热；热度；发烧；狂热；激情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ネツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あつ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">熱い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">热；烫；滚烫；热烈；炽热；火热；急躁；易怒；热情洋溢；热血；激烈；剧烈；极端；热门；受关注的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">熱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ねつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">热；热量；发热；发烧；体温；热情；热诚；激情；狂热；热潮</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">熱帯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ねったい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">热带</span></li></ul></div></li>"]